Package: arabic-lexicon
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lysa <lysa@example.com>
Installed-Size: 76
Depends: python3:any, python3-pyqt6, qt6-wayland, fonts-noto-core
Recommends: fonts-sil-scheherazade, fonts-sil-awami-nastaliq
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Offline Arabic→English dictionary with RTL UI
 A lightweight dictionary: type Arabic, see English meanings,
 part of speech and example sentences. Native Wayland support,
 right-to-left layout for Arabic text.
